;Two things to remember!
*[[Image:Flag of the United States.svg|20px]] '''U.S. USERS''': If you prefer '''meter''' over '''metre''' for your article, simply attatch <code><nowiki>|sp=us</nowiki></code> to the end of the template!
*To make the units [[Wikipedia:Manual of Style (links)|link]] to unit articles, add <code><nowiki>|lk=on</nowiki></code> to the end of the template!  The [[WP:MOS|manual of style]] suggests that you only link the first instance.<br/><br/>Use in the following matter: <code><nowiki>{{convert|original value|original unit|conversion unit|round to}}</nowiki></code><br/><br/>'''Rounding:''' The number given for rounding rounds off the result to the power of 1/10 the rounding number.  For instance, if the result is 8621 and the round number is '-2', the result will be 8700.  If the result is '234.0283043' and the round number is '0', the result will be 234.
